{
  "about": "Labels for the C# duplication corpus. Methods are named Type.Method. A group's members all do the same thing (every pair is Type 4 and equal); each member names how it is written. A pair has a clone type (1-3 for copies; 0 for unrelated code that only looks alike) and whether it is equal (same result for every input).",
